One important recommendation

If you’re going to repeatedly use Claude to maintain the page, don’t make the HTML the source of truth.

Use:

Markdown/structured architecture specification → Claude → Confluence HTML

The HTML should be the published presentation, not the canonical architecture document. This also makes it much easier to review changes in Git, have Claude update individual sections, and prevent formatting degradation over multiple iterations.
